@startuml doctor-sequence-json
title Sequencia - emacs-a11y (modo interativo + doctor json)

actor Support
participant CLI
participant "Interactive Loop" as Loop
participant "Context Router" as Router
participant "Diagnostic Orchestrator" as Orch
participant "Check Registry" as Registry
participant "Platform Adapter" as Adapter
participant "JSON Renderer" as JsonRenderer
participant "Operating System" as OS

Support -> CLI : emacs-a11y
CLI -> Loop : start(root)
Loop --> Support : help contextual raiz
Support -> Loop : doctor
Loop -> Router : dispatch("doctor", root)
Router --> Loop : push(doctor)
Loop --> Support : help contextual doctor
Support -> Loop : json
Loop -> Router : dispatch("json", doctor)
Router -> Orch : run_diagnostic()
Orch -> Registry : load_checks(os)
Registry --> Orch : checks[]
Orch -> Adapter : collect_environment_state()
Adapter -> OS : read-only probes
OS --> Adapter : environment signals
Adapter --> Orch : EnvironmentState

loop for each check
  Orch -> Registry : execute(check, state)
  Registry --> Orch : DiagnosticResult
end

Orch -> JsonRenderer : render(report)
JsonRenderer --> Loop : JSON payload
Loop --> Support : json
Support -> Loop : exit
Loop --> CLI : exit code
CLI --> Support : encerramento limpo

note over CLI,OS
Read-only diagnostics only.
Same semantic results as text mode.
end note
@enduml
